{"id":"n24833-2-8","stage":2,"title":"작은어머니 · 庶母","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n24833-2-8-1","ko":"네 아버지가 밖에서 여자를 하나 데리고 왔구나.","zh":"你爸爸从外面带了个女人回来。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아버지가","meaning":"父亲，爸爸","explanation":"아버지：父亲，爸爸；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"아버지","audio":"/audio/af4870c15b98485bf462.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71343","senseId":"1","lemma":"아버지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"밖에서","meaning":"外面，外边","explanation":"밖：外面，外边；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"밖","audio":"/audio/c54dd45d274b6e4660ea.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17878","senseId":"4","lemma":"밖","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"여자를","meaning":"女子，女人","explanation":"여자：女子，女人；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"여자","audio":"/audio/3109db6ce062c8633018.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27369","senseId":"1","lemma":"여자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하나","meaning":"一","explanation":"하나：一","readings":[{"term":"하나","audio":"/audio/556dcbf069a950eb94f3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20279","senseId":"1","lemma":"하나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"데리고","meaning":"带领，带","explanation":"데리다：带领，带；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"데리다","audio":"/audio/1ffe7355b76c9caa0290.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61342","senseId":"1","lemma":"데리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"왔구나.","meaning":"来，来到","explanation":"오다：来，来到；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；구나：对新发现或新理解的情况表示感叹，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"1","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"af4870c15b98485b","term":"아버지","zh":"父亲，爸爸","audio":"/audio/af4870c15b98485bf462.mp3","entryId":"71343","definition":"用于指称或称呼生育自己的男子。","pronunciation":["아버지"]},{"id":"c54dd45d274b6e46","term":"밖","zh":"外面，外边","audio":"/audio/c54dd45d274b6e4660ea.mp3","entryId":"17878","definition":"不被某个包围的空间。","pronunciation":["박"]},{"id":"3109db6ce062c863","term":"여자","zh":"女子，女人","audio":"/audio/3109db6ce062c8633018.mp3","entryId":"27369","definition":"作为女性出生的人。","pronunciation":["여자"]},{"id":"556dcbf069a950eb","term":"하나","zh":"一","audio":"/audio/556dcbf069a950eb94f3.mp3","entryId":"20279","definition":"数数时的第一个数字。","pronunciation":["하나"]},{"id":"1ffe7355b76c9caa","term":"데리다","zh":"带领，带","audio":"/audio/1ffe7355b76c9caa0290.mp3","entryId":"61342","definition":"让某人或动物与自己在一起。","pronunciation":["데리다"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"来，来到","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"从别的地方移动到这个地方。","pronunciation":["오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/17d7e27b09e815a3c0c4.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n24833-2-8-2","ko":"요즘 세상에 작은어머니가 생기다니 말이 됩니까?","zh":"都什么年代了，竟然还纳妾，这像话吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"요즘","meaning":"最近，近来，这阵子","explanation":"요즘：最近，近来，这阵子","readings":[{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20250","senseId":"1","lemma":"요즘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"세상에","meaning":"无比，极其","explanation":"세상：无比，极其；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"세상","audio":"/audio/412ee72fe0ab7746e409.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62441","senseId":"5","lemma":"세상","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"작은어머니가","meaning":"庶母，小妈","explanation":"작은어머니：庶母，小妈；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"작은어머니","audio":"/audio/7d6959b636283fbe3588.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24833","senseId":"2","lemma":"작은어머니","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"생기다니","meaning":"发生，产生","explanation":"생기다：发生，产生；다니：对得知的内容表示惊讶、感叹，并连接后文。","readings":[{"term":"생기다","audio":"/audio/fc2a5a2e23bd6357d176.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67898","senseId":"3","lemma":"생기다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"말이","meaning":"真是的，不像话","explanation":"말：真是的，不像话；이：用在 아니다、되다 等前，标记否定或变化涉及的身份、状态。","readings":[{"term":"말","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27260","senseId":"9","lemma":"말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"됩니까?","meaning":"某个事情不被允许。主要用于反问句，或和否定副词连用。","explanation":"되다：某个事情不被允许。主要用于反问句，或和否定副词连用。；ㅂ니까：正式礼貌的疑问句末。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"20","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"828c4030dd68aa7b","term":"요즘","zh":"最近，近来，这阵子","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3","entryId":"20250","definition":"从非常近的过去到现在之间。","pronunciation":["요즘"]},{"id":"412ee72fe0ab7746","term":"세상","zh":"无比，极其","audio":"/audio/412ee72fe0ab7746e409.mp3","entryId":"62441","definition":"无法比较的，非常。","pronunciation":["세ː상"]},{"id":"7d6959b636283fbe","term":"작은어머니","zh":"庶母，小妈","audio":"/audio/7d6959b636283fbe3588.mp3","entryId":"24833","definition":"原配夫人的子女用于指称或称呼父亲的妾。","pronunciation":["자근어머니"]},{"id":"fc2a5a2e23bd6357","term":"생기다","zh":"发生，产生","audio":"/audio/fc2a5a2e23bd6357d176.mp3","entryId":"67898","definition":"出现事故或事情、问题等。","pronunciation":["생기다"]},{"id":"dfbb3ea79fc80c6f","term":"말","zh":"真是的，不像话","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3","entryId":"27260","definition":"对某种行为未能实现表示慨叹。","pronunciation":["말ː"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"某个事情不被允许。主要用于反问句，或和否定副词连用。","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"某个事情不被允许。主要用于反问句，或和否定副词连用。","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]}],"audio":"/audio/b5ed56fe1a82caee574d.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.565,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/Search